          "text": "Description: On November 26, 1977, around 6:30 PM, a driver and his passenger observed a luminous phenomenon that intrigued them. Throughout their journey, the phenomenon was spotted changing shape but maintaining its red-orange color. It did not appear to be moving. No other testimony about this phenomenon was collected, and we lack details.",
